{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"alias":"pearly-basic-honeyeater","creation_channel":"cli","description":"## Context / Problem\n\nThe CLI and MCP accept reviewer selection at `src/rebar/_cli/_parsers/advanced/llm.py:56-72` and `src/rebar/_mcp_llm.py:93-124`, but `src/rebar/llm/code_review/shim.py:117-174` discards it. Callers can pay for the same gate-run while believing they selected its reviewers.\n\n## Approach\n\nImmediately remove reviewer-selection input from CLI parsing, the MCP method and generated input schema, and the keyword-only Python signature. Keep gate-owned overlay selection and the result `reviewers` field. This is an intentional pre-1.0 breaking change, not a deprecation period.\n\n## Scope\n\n- code-review CLI parser and help\n- MCP method/schema and Python review-code signature\n- API/MCP baselines, docs, changelog, and ADR 0075 supersession note\n- contract tests\n\nCascade flag: true. Recensus static, dynamic, documentation, fixture, and monkeypatch callers.\n\n## Testing\n\nExercise CLI parsing, MCP schema validation, Python signature rejection, and the no-billable-call boundary for old invocations.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] CLI `--reviewer`, MCP `review_code.reviewers`, and Python `reviewers=` inputs are absent from their contracts.\n- [ ] Old calls fail at parsing, schema, or signature validation before a billable model call.\n- [ ] Gate-owned reviewer selection remains and result `reviewers` accurately reports reviewers that ran.\n- [ ] API/MCP baselines, docs, changelog, and ADR 0075 state the pre-1.0 breaking replacement: omit selection and inspect result reviewers.","id":"3c2f-01aa-7ea1-409b","parent_id":"78f2-b104-e3c9-4b86","priority":2,"tags":["janitor","api","breaking-change","rp18"],"ticket_type":"story","title":"Remove caller-selected reviewer inputs from code review contracts"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"CREATE","timestamp":1788313649310830001,"uuid":"9b4d29a9-de90-4d9e-a282-33381b496471"}